# <frame|+increment> <command> [hold_frames]
# A +increment is relative to the preceding event (the initial frame is zero).
# Analog input: <frame|+increment> analog <x> <y>; JOY0_ANALOG = { Y, X }, signed 8-bit values
# Commands: b1, b2, b1b2, analog, trace_on, trace_off, instructions_on, instructions_off, quit
154 b1
414 b1 5
460 b1
500 analog 0 -128

# Equivalent relative schedule:
# 154 b1
# +260 b1 5
# +46 b1
# +40 analog 0 -128
